### ========================================
### PHASE 2: Updating (PUT)
### ========================================

### 1.5 PUT Valid Usuario (Expects 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo.email@gmail.com",
  "senha": "novaSenha321",
  "tipoUsuario": "PROFESSOR"
}

### 1.6 PUT Invalid Usuario (Expects 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalido"
}

### 2.5 PUT Valid Curso (Expects 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cursos/1
Content-Type: application/json

